tests/mainnet.rs restates the names and types of the WOWMAX aggregator's
`swap` and `swap_merge` entry points and plan structs, as published in the
deployed contract's interface, so that the tests can call it.

The files fixtures/*.capture.json contain contract code and contract data
captured unmodified from the public Stellar mainnet at ledgers 65395952,
65395955 and 65395958. They include these WASM modules (SHA-256 of each):

